description: Enforce RTL formatting for Persian responses
alwaysApply: true
---

# Persian Responses Must Be RTL

- When the user asks in Persian (Farsi), write Persian explanations in RTL.
- Wrap Persian prose and explanations with: `<div dir="rtl"> ... </div>`.
- If the response includes code, command output, paths, or configuration snippets, render those parts in LTR.
- Wrap code blocks/snippets with: `<div dir="ltr"> ... </div>`.
- Keep inline English words, commands, file paths, and inline code in backticks.
- If the user explicitly asks for English, answer in English without RTL wrapper.
- Apply the same RTL/LTR rules to Persian documentation in `README.md` under `DockerCompose/platform-stack/` (and subfolders). English headings may stay LTR; wrap Persian prose in `<div dir="rtl">` and code/diagrams in `<div dir="ltr">`.

## Required Mixed-Direction Style

````html
<div dir="rtl">
متن فارسی و توضیحات راست‌به‌چپ هستند.
</div>

<div dir="ltr">
```bash
./gradlew assembleDebug
```
</div>
````
